From ad551c0321c237c44ed948ca591cfc002955b7d8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yuya Fujiwara <hzw1258@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 13 Jul 2026 14:06:03 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 13/18] Promote date candidates to first page

Move date conversion out of the rewriter chain and into an explicit
candidate insertion step. Introduce CandidateSource::Date to distinguish
date candidates from generic rewriter output, then insert them right
after the top model candidate in build_conversion_candidates so they
land on the first page instead of the rewriter tail.

Remove DateRewriter from the default rewriter chain and the
config-conditional build_rewriters method, simplifying initialization
to always use RewriterChain::default_chain(). The engine now handles
date candidate insertion at insertion time, giving explicit control over
their placement and visibility.
